      <DisplayName>Arcane Stabilizer</DisplayName>
      <Description>Full 1x3x1 large-grid pillar; align Up with core Up. Attach to the front-center Energy Core socket, connector/forward face toward the core. Supports standard capacity and transfer modules. Loss disables unsupported modules without deleting stored charge.</Description>
